  "details": "If you got friend requests from user accounts that have been deleted, you're no longer able to remove them from your friend request list when using a Steam Account (and I'd guess Oculus).\nNot able to check on the website, since we can't sign in with neither Steam or Oculus.\n\nPossible this can happen on a VRChat account too, but not tested.\n\nSteam account used: usr_0dff5135-f633-4fc3-ba43-8eb7923ca570\n\nRepo:\n- Friend request from another account\n- delete the \"another account\"\n- Friend request can not be clicked to accept or remove.",
